  unitName: Thunder Crystal
  unitId: 40324
  unitNumber: 432
  description: This magical creature is said to systemize and store all Thunder-related
    knowledge that Metal Units can hold within them. They are good listeners, which
    make them very well-liked among the talkative Metal species. They seem to enjoy
    listening and give exaggerated responses, but appear to forget everything a couple
    of hours later. They are more than happy to listen to the same story repeatedly,
    but they fail to remember the important facts, therefore it is believed that
    it's impossible for them to keep promises.
  summonDesc: Are you gonna fuse me?<br>Weee! I can't wait!<br>Um, what happens after
    I'm fused?
